    LLM: '1. Deal 4. 2. Bidding (10, 20, etc., or Thunee). Highest bidder sets Trump. 3. Deal 2. 4. Play tricks. Must follow suit. Trumping allowed if void. 5. Scoring: Card values: J=30, 9=20, A=11, 10=10, K=3, Q=2. Total 104 points (plus bonus?).',
    Player: '1. Deal 4. 2. Bidding (10, 20, etc., or Thunee). Highest bidder sets Trump. 3. Deal 2. 4. Play tricks. Must follow suit. Trumping allowed if void. 5. Scoring: Card values: J=30, 9=20, A=11, 10=10, K=3, Q=2. Total 104 points (plus bonus?).',
